7./api Proxy Rule Add Karo (Vhost Editor Se)Static site ke 'Vhost' tab mein jao, existing Nginx config ke andar ek naya location /api {...} block add karo jo backend ke port (jo Node.js site ko assign hua) pe proxy_pass kare. Ye ensure karega ki frontend ke /api calls automatically backend tak pahunche, same domain se, koi CORS issue nahi hoga.
8.SSL Enable Karo Dono Sites PeHar site (Node.js + Static) ke 'SSL/TLS' tab mein jao → 'New Let's Encrypt Certificate' → Create. Free SSL milega, auto-renew hoga. Domain DNS pehle se VPS IP pe point hona chahiye is step se pehle.
                                                                                                                                                                                           
